flowchart LR
    IN["Request<br/>name='Juan Perez'<br/>document_id='1712345678'"] --> V[Validate<br/>Pydantic]
    V --> VAULT[(PII vault<br/>AES-GCM encrypted columns<br/>HMAC hash for lookup)]
    V --> REF["prospect_ref = UUID<br/>pseudonyms: PERSON_1, DOC_1"]
    REF --> STATE[Graph state + checkpoints<br/>no raw PII<br/>+ encrypted serializer]
    STATE --> LLM[OpenRouter LLM<br/>sees PERSON_1 only]
    STATE --> TOOLS[Tools<br/>resolve real values<br/>from vault internally]
    VAULT --> TOOLS
    FREE[Free text: client msgs,<br/>analyst notes] --> PRES[Presidio<br/>detect + redact] --> LLM
    STATE --> EV[(Events<br/>pseudonymous)]
    EV --> AN[(Analytics schema<br/>aggregates, k>=5)]
    AN --> GR[Grafana / UI dashboard]
    STATE --> OUT[Final response<br/>re-identified only at render]
    VAULT --> OUT
    LOGS[Logs] -. masking processor .- STATE
